{
  "facts": [
    {
      "topic": "scope",
      "statement": "The entry performs streaming compression followed by streaming and in-place decompression of the resulting frames.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085",
          "start_line": 81,
          "end_line": 135,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085",
          "start_line": 185,
          "end_line": 205,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the decompression operations applied to the compressed output."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "trigger",
      "statement": "The harness helper requests a strategy from ZSTD_STRATEGY_MIN through ZSTD_STRATEGY_MAX, adjusts the compression parameters, and sets the resulting strategy on the compression context. The supplied lines do not establish which requested strategies survive adjustment.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-6b301a2f40efcfbb4780",
          "start_line": 44,
          "end_line": 56,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-d12ebcf33fdbb6d713f7",
          "start_line": 101,
          "end_line": 110,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Passes the adjusted strategy to ZSTD_CCtx_setParameter."
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-165c220943e131573f13",
          "start_line": 29,
          "end_line": 49,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows how input bytes determine a value within the requested range."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "Before the change, ZSTD_selectBlockCompressor maps strategy and dictionary mode to named compressor functions, optionally uses a row-based table, and asserts that the selected function is nonnull.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-e537147eba1ba4b356a4",
          "start_line": 2990,
          "end_line": 3062,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "After the change, ZSTD_adjustCParams_internal conditionally cascades excluded strategies toward lower strategies; ZSTD_selectBlockCompressor uses ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK_* entries and still asserts that the selected function is nonnull.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-31b9fce4fcddd0beca8e",
          "start_line": 1470,
          "end_line": 1510,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-0adc4df26dbe6bc8986a",
          "start_line": 3032,
          "end_line": 3115,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "configuration",
      "statement": "The after-source makefile defaults both compressor exclusion variables to zero. If either is set nonzero, its conditional adds the listed ZSTD_EXCLUDE_* compiler definitions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-3bbc39a69a0b005f3b1d",
          "start_line": 47,
          "end_line": 51,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-3bbc39a69a0b005f3b1d",
          "start_line": 184,
          "end_line": 190,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Maps nonzero exclusion variables to compiler definitions."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "configuration",
      "statement": "The supplied build script delegates fuzz-target compilation to fuzz.py build all; these lines alone do not determine the effective compiler definitions for stream_round_trip.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-043cf5aa9ced10a35cb6",
          "start_line": 19,
          "end_line": 24,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-3bbc39a69a0b005f3b1d",
          "start_line": 184,
          "end_line": 190,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows why the effective make variables matter to the exclusion condition."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "target_route",
      "statement": "ZSTD_compressStream2 initializes a context at the initial stream stage and then calls either the multithreaded path when workers are enabled or ZSTD_compressStream_generic. ZSTD_buildSeqStore selects and calls a block compressor on its software path and on sequence-producer fallback.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-8701eeeda36b1074f936",
          "start_line": 6285,
          "end_line": 6314,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-8701eeeda36b1074f936",
          "start_line": 6365,
          "end_line": 6370,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-e47bbab13fc8d06f6025",
          "start_line": 3330,
          "end_line": 3355,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the selector calls in block sequence construction."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "alternative",
      "statement": "There are conditional routes that can avoid this selector: a successfully processed external sequence-producer result returns early, and a sufficiently small block is left uncompressed. Their availability for an excluded selected strategy is not established here.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-e47bbab13fc8d06f6025",
          "start_line": 3206,
          "end_line": 3215,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-e47bbab13fc8d06f6025",
          "start_line": 3286,
          "end_line": 3328,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-194debf8ea4cd55b47ba",
          "start_line": 156,
          "end_line": 164,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the helper's conditional sequence-producer registration."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "consequence",
      "statement": "The existing harness checks streaming compression returns for errors, then requires successful decompression, the original size, and byte equality for both decompression routes. A compression error would fail an existing FUZZ_ZASSERT.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085",
          "start_line": 81,
          "end_line": 128,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085",
          "start_line": 185,
          "end_line": 205,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-a7cd9e43defd8d40468a",
          "start_line": 40,
          "end_line": 47,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Defines error and assertion checks to abort on failure."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "The exclusion-trigger premise is unresolved for the fixed target: the after-source makefile defaults the exclusion variables to zero, while the supplied build script delegates compilation and does not establish whether those defaults govern this target or are overridden.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-3bbc39a69a0b005f3b1d",
          "start_line": 47,
          "end_line": 51,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-043cf5aa9ced10a35cb6",
          "start_line": 19,
          "end_line": 24,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Delegates target compilation to fuzz.py."
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-3bbc39a69a0b005f3b1d",
          "start_line": 184,
          "end_line": 190,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows that nonzero settings would activate exclusion definitions."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "missing_information": [
    "The effective stream_round_trip build path and compiler definitions through tests/fuzz/fuzz.py and tests/fuzz/Makefile, including whether lib/libzstd.mk governs this target and whether either exclusion variable is overridden.",
    "The definitions of the ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK_* dispatch macros under the effective build definitions.",
    "The call path from ZSTD_compressStream_generic through parameter adjustment and block sequence construction, if needed to establish the excluded-strategy condition for this entry."
  ],
  "requested_symbols": [
    "ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK_*",
    "ZSTD_compressStream_generic",
    "ZSTD_CCtx_init_compressStream2",
    "ZSTD_adjustCParams"
  ],
  "requested_paths": [
    "tests/fuzz/fuzz.py",
    "tests/fuzz/Makefile",
    "lib/compress/zstd_double_fast.h",
    "lib/compress/zstd_lazy.h",
    "lib/compress/zstd_opt.h"
  ]
}
